OL,3,GNEWSAFormer journalist and Lost Lives
OL,4,Aauthor David McKittrick dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe renowned journalist and author
OL,7,FDavid McKittrick has died.
OL,9,FMcKittrick was best known for his work
OL,10,Fduring the Troubles, and the book Lost
OL,11,FLives.
OL,13,FJournalists and politicians from across
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland have paid tribute.
OL,16,FPublished in 1999, Lost Lives was a
OL,17,Fbook detailing the people who died as a
OL,18,Fresult of the Troubles.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
